sec.p:
Table 1 lists the firms in our present sample, their precise sample periods, and a few descriptive summary statistics for each, to illustrate that there is some variety among them. There the reader will note that this full sample length of ca. 15,000 days is not available for several of the more newly-listed companies, such as Tesla and NVIDIA.Table 1
