The reader might want to recall at this point that it is our larger sample here (of 15 firms) which enabled us to observe that the maximum absolute sample excursion which the pre-whitened returns take during the course of a typical sample is a positive excursion for about half of the firms and a negative excursion for the other half of the firms. This observed symmetry is why we here concentrate upon (and define) ZsampMAX\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
